{"title":"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fraction\" title=\"Fraction\">fraction</a> of the large <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Rectangle\" title=\"Rectangle\">rectangular</a> region is shaded?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/7/91759793cea2432ee42cbdf28fed6a8f3cd3c9b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] fill((15,0)--(18,0)--(18,6)--(15,6)--cycle,grey); draw((0,0)--(18,0)--(18,12)--(0,12)--cycle); draw((0,6)--(18,6)); for(int a=6; a&lt;12; ++a)  {   draw((1.5a,0)--(1.5a,6));  }  label(&quot;0&quot;,(0,0),W); label(&quot;9&quot;,(9,0),S); label(&quot;18&quot;,(18,0),S); label(&quot;6&quot;,(0,6),W); label(&quot;12&quot;,(0,12),W); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"172\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/9483f8b95799cf7ec3f1bb95ac8555d36096a279.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{108} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{18} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{12} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac29 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\frac13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"385\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The rectangle is divided into upper and lower halves, and then the lower half is divided into left and right halves.  The lower right section is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e5992bf70a872b6e72313fc370541ec9733bb784.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"37\" /> of the area of the entire rectangle.  Since this section is divided into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> equal rectangles, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of which are shaded, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the lower-right section is shaded, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b62fdd687e697e09b00a41dcefc61179027f794d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"133\" height=\"49\" /> of the large rectangle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The total area of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5dbacb8b932f3277fa36ba565f44f5c9b496b30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 \\cdot 18 = 216$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"103\" height=\"14\" />.  The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinate of the left edge of the shaded area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/2/dd247efdc605218cc499decb7fc82e435f0a02e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{6} = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\" /> of the way from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/7767559784640919e685d32dbfb9d7baa2ce539a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 + \\frac{2}{3} \\cdot 9 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"111\" height=\"38\" />.  Therefore, the shaded area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba26076dd15c09c98adae221689262d39a8da893.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\cdot 3 = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/647e414a88ff3e713b709b6b1c2cf71bf28e4bc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{18}{216} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{12}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"125\" height=\"49\" /> of the entire rectangle is shaded.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME\" title=\"1987 AJHSME\">1987 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1987 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<